            // Gas station — small-format fuel stop + convenience store.
            // Phase 4.5 refuel economy anchor: when player lands within
            // N m of a gas_station cell, refuel is available; prices
            // scale with remoteness (Major-hub-area cheap; remote expensive).
            // CoastalBoreal home; bleeds to all biomes (gas stations are
            // universal). 3.6.3c placement rules: requires_road_adjacency
            // (NOT enforced in 3.6.3b — low selection_weight keeps per-cell
            // rarity reasonable until 3.6.3c road engine activates the
            // adjacency gate); hub_proximity Major 30 / Regional 10 km;
            // self-spacing 20 km.
            // Render primitives: 1× flat quad (canopy roof) + 4× cylinder
